Page title: {{steps.page.title}}

Read the page below. Return speech: exactly three plain sentences for someone listening (no lists, no markdown, no URLs). Return report: a markdown summary with a heading, 4-6 bullet points of the key facts, and nothing else.

{{steps.clean.text}}

forged_limbs.code:
def run(text, limit):
    text = text or ''
    lines = [' '.join(l.split()) for l in text.splitlines()]
    keep = [l for l in lines if len(l) >= 40 or (l.endswith('.') and len(l) > 15)]
    out = '\n'.join(keep)[:int(limit)]
    return {'text': out, 'chars': len(out), 'too_short': len(out) <= 200}

def run(title, too_short, summary):
    if summary:
        return {'speech': summary, 'note': ''}
    name = title or 'that page'
    return {'speech': f'I fetched {name}, but there was too little text on it to summarize.', 'note': 'too short'}
